# ==============================================================================
# 🛡️ TRUTH DECODER - 终极防御协议 V5.7
# 作用：物理隔离机密、状态、日志与系统废料
# 适用：Next.js + Supabase + Python Scraper (Edge Runtime Friendly)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 核心机密资产 (Secrets & Environment) - 【红线禁区】
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
!.env.example

# 证书与密钥凭证
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account-file.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. 依赖黑洞 (Dependencies)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Python 环境隔离
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
venv/
.venv/
env/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
.python-version
.pdm.python-version
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. 框架编译与构建产物 (Builds & Frameworks)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
.parcel-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel/
.turbo/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 业务状态与持久化数据 (Project Specific States) - 【针对 TruthDecoder 深度优化】
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 拦截爬虫本地历史记录，防止云端数据逻辑冲突
seen_urls.txt
truth_scraper/seen_urls.txt
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# 爬虫自动化浏览器缓存 (Playwright/Puppeteer)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
playwright/.local-browsers

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. 运行日志与测试缓存 (Logs & Coverage)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.log
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. 编辑器与操作系统 (OS & IDEs & Configs)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.sln
*.sw?

# 屏蔽本地包管理器特定配置，防止覆盖云端镜像环境
.npmrc
.yarnrc

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. 媒体与临时资源缓存 (Temp Media/Assets)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
tmp/
temp/